<title>UK: IADB sets 150 million rand 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets 150 million rand 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.0	MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.45    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
